Upstream work
-------------

This add-on is a fork of Auto Profile Picture 2.5.0, by Noam SCHMITT, also
licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0.

    Auto Profile Picture
    Copyright (c) Noam SCHMITT
    https://astucesweb.fr/projets/auto-profile-picture/

The fork adds a configurable provider chain, privacy modes for online
lookups, per-sender rules, user-controlled cache lifetimes, avatar shape and
initials colour, and a rebuilt settings page. Files carried over from the
upstream project remain under the same licence.


